          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Check that GA4 conversion events are firing correctly — purchases, form fills, clicks to call.&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;HowToStep&quot;,
          &quot;position&quot;: 2
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Build one weekly dashboard&quot;,
          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Use Looker Studio to display 5–7 key metrics and share it with your team every Monday.&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;HowToStep&quot;,
          &quot;position&quot;: 3
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Run one A/B test per month&quot;,
          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Test one variable — a subject line, a landing page headline, an ad creative — and wait for at least 100 conversions per variant.&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;HowToStep&quot;,
